      "title": "Core Relational Contracts",
      "items": [
        "User (1:N) Booking: Guest creates multiple reservations with unique bookingReference codes",
        "Booking (N:M) Room: Bookings contain room array with frozen pricePerNight snapshots",
        "Booking (1:N) Payment: Immutable financial ledger tracking Stripe, card, and cash settlements"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Feedback & Pricing Integrity",
      "items": [
