        "Coupon (1:N) Booking: Validates expiration, minimum stay, and percentage or fixed discount limits"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Governance & Stock Monitoring",
      "items": [
        "User (1:N) AuditLog: Immutable security audit trail recording staff actions, IPs, and changes",
